<title>GERMANY: Aero Lloyd to add sixth Airbus A320 in fleet upgrade.</title>
<headline>Aero Lloyd to add sixth Airbus A320 in fleet upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>German holiday carrier Aero Lloyd said it will take delivery of its sixth Airbus A320 on April 1.</p>
<p>A spokesman told Reuters the private airline was modernising its fleet which would now comprise 21 aircraft, including 15 McDonnell Douglas MD-83s.</p>
<p>Aero Lloyd flies charter and scheduled flights to European tourist destinations. -- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706; Fax: 5017</p>
